          "type": "heading",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Don't 'Try' to Sleep",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Lying in bed feeling stressed about not sleeping is the worst. Sleep experts recommend that if you can't fall asleep after about 20 minutes, you should get out of bed. Go to another room and do something calm and boring—like reading a dull book—until you start to feel sleepy, then go back to bed.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "linebreak",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "type": "heading",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "When Habits Aren't Enough: Adding Natural Support",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Sometimes, even with the best habits and the perfect environment, things like stress or just life itself can get in the way of a good night's sleep. In those cases, adding some natural support to your routine can make a real difference.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
