          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "This is where a supplement like NuviaLab Relax can be helpful. It's not a magic pill, but rather a tool to complement all the healthy habits you're building. It's designed with a combination of 10 natural ingredients that work together to promote a sense of calmness and emotional balance.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Instead of forcing you to sleep, NuviaLab Relax helps your body and mind relax naturally. Its ingredients have an adaptogenic effect, helping your body better manage stress, which is often the biggest enemy of sleep. By supporting your cognitive abilities and inducing a state of calm, it contributes to improving your overall sleep quality, helping you feel more rested and refreshed.",
