          "type": "heading",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "How long will it take for these new habits to improve my sleep?",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "It varies for everyone, but most people start to notice a difference within one to two weeks of being consistent. The key is consistency! Stick with it, and your body will adjust.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "type": "heading",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Are naps good or bad for sleep?",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Naps can be great if you do them right! The expert consensus is to keep them short, around 10 to 30 minutes, and to take them in the early afternoon. This can boost alertness without interfering with your nighttime sleep.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
